msgid "Primary Key"
msgstr "ዋና ቁልፍ"

#: wmi_queries.php
msgid "When a WMI Query returns multiple rows, which Keyname will be the primary key or index?  If the Primary Key includes multiple columns, separate them with a comma."
msgstr "አንድ የWMI መጠይቅ ብዙ ረድፎችን ሲመልስ፣ የትኛው ቁልፍ ስም (Keyname) ዋና ቁልፍ ወይም መረጃ ጠቋሚ (index) ይሆናል? ዋናው ቁልፍ ብዙ አምዶችን የሚያካትት ከሆነ በነጠላ ሰረዝ ይለዩዋቸው።"

#: wmi_queries.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following WMI Queries."
